The JPEGs in this directory are downscaled sRGB derivatives of that TIFF:
1-solen.jpg is the full mural (museum frame cropped); 2-solen-disk.jpg and
3-solen-rays.jpg are detail crops of the same photograph.
`wallpaper.webp` at the repo root (README display) is an empty-desktop
screenshot showing the mural with the system bar; `wallpaper-disk.webp`
and `wallpaper-rays.webp` are the same kind of shot on the detail crops.
